/target

# Rendered from cairn/items by `cairn render`; CI uploads it from main as
# the `roadmap` artifact. Untracked so no branch carries it (DESIGN.md §8a).
/ROADMAP.md

# cairn's lock while a command writes items. Ignored so `cairn migrate` and a
# mid-command `git status` never read it as an uncommitted change.
/cairn/items/.lock
